{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","达赫妮婆婆"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名拥有荧荧花装备的绿裔坦克，能够吸收敌人能量，且受到伤害时可以降低敌人急速。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","孩子们，到我身后来！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Get behind me children!"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","年纪越大就越结实！"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","One only gets stronger with age!"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","给我——站住！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Hey! Hold it right there."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","我也，枯萎了啊……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","I'm withered too..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","我还结实得很哪！"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","I'm still pretty solid!"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","来吧，孩子们，到达赫妮婆婆这儿来！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","又是个好天气。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","岁数大了，眼睛总是不舒服，不错，还能看琴。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","来吧，孩子们，想吃点什么？达赫妮婆婆这儿都有。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","好孩子，这份礼物真是送到我心坎上了！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","礼物无所谓，婆婆已经收到了你的心意！呵呵！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","孩子们，要吃点什么？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","再织件新毛衣吧！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","婆婆炖了热汤！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","噢，下雪了！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","节日大餐就交给婆婆！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","这里真够亮堂！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","吃完晚饭再出门！"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","达赫妮对烹饪十分热衷，从年轻时就自告奋勇地为身边的人提供热乎乎的食物。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","达赫妮年轻时是薄暮丛林最有名的战士，可断树，可碎石，性格也豪迈无比。大家都说，现在也能从达赫妮身上看到过去女战士的影子。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","月湖村的草药园最早时是达赫妮帮忙开辟的，后来由于事务繁忙，由现在的草药园主代为看管。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","达赫妮的伞杖具有生命——伞上顶着一颗活的魔花种子，达赫妮经常为伞杖浇水保养。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","达赫妮十分喜欢帕瑞莎，因为帕瑞莎是她见过最守规矩的孩子。不过偶尔她也会担忧，帕瑞莎有些过于恪守程式和规则。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","“达赫妮的脾气已经有所收敛了，你要是认识年轻的她，就会觉得她现在已经很温柔了。”雅顿如此评价道。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","据说，雅顿的犄角上有一道伤疤，是年轻时和达赫妮发生口角时留下的。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","达赫妮总是提防着达米安靠近月湖村的种植园，但没能防住达米安出于好心发明的自动浇花器。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","达赫妮本人嗜辣，但为了照顾薄暮丛林众人普遍清淡的口味，总是只放很少的调味料，最终适得其反，导致熬煮的食物过于寡淡。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","达赫妮特别收藏的几种香料中，有一种并不产自绿裔，而是来自于耀光一种花语为“永远幸福”的植物。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","没想到会在这里见到先祖，真是奇妙的缘分啊！"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415707.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","达赫妮婆婆 & 缇洛亚"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","啊哈哈哈哈！毛线球！滚来滚去的毛线球！"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415034.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","蕾米雅 & 达赫妮婆婆"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","孩子们，要吃点什么？"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415102.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","达赫妮婆婆"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","婆婆炖了热汤！"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415103.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","达赫妮婆婆"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","噢，下雪了！"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415411.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","达赫妮婆婆"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","节日大餐就交给婆婆！"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415412.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","达赫妮婆婆"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","春焰庆啊，真是个不错的节日……"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415510.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","洛桑 & 达赫妮婆婆"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","这里真够亮堂！"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415583.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","达赫妮婆婆"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","吃完晚饭再出门！"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415584.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","达赫妮婆婆"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","嘿，达米安，我离开丛林都三年了，你肯定做出来不少好东西吧？"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412090.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","洛桑 & 达米安 & 达赫妮"],["/interaction_records/9/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","薄暮丛林"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","好孩子，真没想到，你们在薄暮丛林外帮了洛桑那么多。"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412160.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","达赫妮 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","最近我总会想起过去的事情……那些岁月呦，都已经变成我们这些老家伙的回忆了。"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10413100.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","达赫妮 & 雅顿"],["/interaction_records/11/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","瓦度索山脉"]]}